Description: A virtual machine creator for x86-64 guests
 A modern virtual machine creator built with GTK4 and libadwaita that
 lets users install and launch QEMU/KVM virtual machines with ease.
 .
 Features:
  - Multi-language support (8 languages)
  - Install and run modes for QEMU/KVM virtual machines
  - UEFI and BIOS boot mode support
  - Configurable RAM, vCPUs and disk size
  - Existing VM disk browser with right-click delete
  - Clean, responsive Adwaita design
